				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;accordion mt-2&#34; id=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_accordion&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;accordion-header&#34; id=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button&#xA;        class=&#34;accordion-button&#34;&#xA;        type=&#34;button&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-target=&#34;#release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;        aria-expanded=&#34;true&#34;&#xA;        aria-controls=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      &gt;Changelog&lt;span class=&#34;badge rounded-pill bg-secondary ms-1&#34;&gt;110&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&#xA;      id=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;accordion-collapse collapse show&#34;&#xA;      aria-labelledby=&#34;release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0&#34;&#xA;      data-bs-parent=&#34;#release-83657c70317637f5217b9aeefa3af582-page-0_accordion&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-body&#34;&gt;&lt;ul class=&#34;list-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;li class=&#34;list-group-item my-auto&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;Publish the DNS evolution article and update blog workflow&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Publish the author&amp;rsquo;s account of moving DNS management from a central&#xA;DNSControl configuration to project-owned Terraform records, with examples&#xA;and directory layouts. Include the author&amp;rsquo;s clarifications and approved&#xA;wording corrections, and remove the draft flag for publication.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Tag both blog posts using existing site topics. Require relevant tags and&#xA;iterative reviews in the blog skill: report findings before validation and&#xA;delivery, repeat after changes, and finish delivery when the review is clear&#xA;or the author ends it. Cover both behaviors in the existing evaluation cases.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
